    narr:narration """This hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) of capturing decision artifacts at the moment of consensus. This foundational position, established in March 2026, serves as the anchor for subsequent team reporting. By late August 2026, the narrative shifts toward operational validation, with [team-level reporting](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787835375249_1) confirming the successful shipment of the async decision widget. This progress is framed through [quantitative performance metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787835375249_2) and the identification of [technical dependencies](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787835375249_3) like the Zephyr integration as critical unlocks. The collection also includes a [meta-inquiry](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryClaims) regarding how the team establishes delivery claims, providing a lens through which to evaluate the relationship between measured velocity and the stated product mission.""" ;
